This code uses the integration of the Grüneisen parameter equation (3.3) found in:
"Thermodynamics with the Grüneisen parameter: Fundamentals and applications to high pressure physics and geophysics" (Stacy et al. 2019)

Final equation used after calculations: v=v_0((v_0)/(v))^gammi_i

Data/ .txt files needed: experimental pressures and Raman peak positions, v_0 (baseline volume), and V. 

BaseValuesFile has: Pressure (GPa) and Volume/unit cell (A^3)
ExperimentalValues has: Pressure (GPa), Wavenumber of peak pos (cm^-1), and peak region (how I defined different peaks)

